[stderr] (`IMP-0013`–`IMP-0020`), below its 250-record limit. `GATE-0004` remains on
[stderr] each affected contract as an implementation gate and was not treated as an
[stderr] authoring blocker. The eight contracts are allocated once between B0007 and
[stderr] B0008 (four outputs each), with asset reservation only in R0018. SHARD-03 and
[stderr] SHARD-04 remain queued, so [`D0003`](../authoring-runbooks/D0003.md) is the
[stderr] sole successor. Counters now append at B0009/R0021; accepted work is unchanged.
[stderr] 
