[stderr] D0001 expanded no chapter and allocated no B/R contracts. `SHARD-02` is the
[stderr] first queued chapter, but `DEC-0004`/`GATE-0004` remains unresolved; `SHARD-03`
[stderr] and `SHARD-04` retain their predecessor and gate blocks, while `SHARD-05` stays
[stderr] held pending explicit authorisation. Every current catalogue contract
[stderr] (`IMP-0001` through `IMP-0012`) is allocated exactly once. The dispatcher
[stderr] therefore created [`D0002`](../authoring-runbooks/D0002.md) as the sole
